  "exact_contract": [
    "Strict exact object fields;schema_version/profile.version integer1. All IDs ASCII [A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_.-]{0,63}. One shared geometry/model/horizon;1..8 distinctscenario IDs withcanonical explicitinitialgrids andchosen reference.",
    "Height/width exactintegers1..64,N<=4096. Grid isalist ofheight rowlists eachwidth exactinteger0or1;bools,floats,strings,ragged rows andimplicit padding reject. Initialcoordinates row-major[r,c],origin top-left.",
    "Finite zero-exterior boundaries:out-of-grid positions dead,no wrap oralias. Eight distinct Moore radius1positions exclude center. Every nextcell readscompletepriorstate;commitallcells together. B3/S23 only;unknownmodels,schedules,boundaries,random orLLM fields reject.",
    "Alwayscompute exactly requestedticks0..256;no earlystop orfastforward. Include t0 plus allactual transitions. At t0 births/deaths=null because no transition occurred. Initial/final complete grids alwaysreturned;optional state_trace contains every t0..T completegrid.",
    "Cycle classification usesexact complete row-major binary-state equality,notaggregatecounts orhash equality alone. Keepfirst occurrence ofeach state;thefirst repeat atj ofearlieri establishescycle_start=i,period=j-i,first_repeat_tick=j. period1=fixed_point;period>1=periodic_cycle. Continue allrequestedticks afterdetection sofinalphase istruthful. No repeat=unclassified,truncated=true. Establishedfixed/cycle classification hastruncated=false. T0 hasno transition,classifiesunclassified andtruncated=true evenifinitialpattern wouldbe stable.",
    "State SHA256 isoverraw row-majorbytes0/1,notASCII digits;geometry/model hashes bindshape. Source/profile/schema/input/code/initial/final/state identities recorded. Inputs copied,notmutated. Liveness isnotconserved orirreversible;birthsanddeaths bothallowed.",
    "Compare eachscenario minusreference atidenticalticks:alive-count differences andcomplete-state Hammingdistance. Finaldifferences includeactual finalgrids,notprojectedafterearlystop. Identicalinitialconfigurations givezero differences. Equalcounts do notimplyequalstates. Differences areconditionalsyntheticmodel sensitivity,notreal-world causal effects.",
    "Resource preflight before neighborhood construction/transitions:cell_ticks=N*T*S<=1000000;neighbor_cell_work=9*cell_ticks<=9000000;returned_state_cells=S*N*(2+(T+1 iftrace_states else0))<=100000;returned_count_cells=S*(10*(T+1)+32)<=20000. Conservative outputreservations include initial/finalgrids andfulltraces/comparisons;inputecho,histories/hashes andfixedmetadata excluded. Individualmaxima cannotfreelycombine;work cap isredundantgivenfactor9 butexplicitly checked. Internalstatehistory isbounded bycell-tick cap plusinitialstates.",
    "Provenance synthetic mustbetrue;source_ref infrozencatalog. Rights self_authored/permission_granted/public_domain/cc_by;nonemptyattribution/snapshot<=4000chars andexactUTF8 snapshotSHA256. Declarations are not independenttruth/rights certification. Noactualhuman/clinical/socialdata ingestion orforecastclaim.",
    "Geometric invariance requiresmatching transformedgeometry/coordinates/boundaries. Arbitrarynodepermutations are notgrid symmetries. Interiortranslation tests needadequateboundaryclearance. Ticks aremodelupdates,notdates. FullLife states andlocalcombinatorics are notempiricaltransition probabilities."
  ],
